Reader Count Concept

We maintain:

readCount

which stores:

How many readers are active?

Example:

Initially:

readCount = 0

Reader 1 enters:

readCount = 1

Reader 2 enters:

readCount = 2

Reader 3 enters:

readCount = 3

All read simultaneously.

Writer Logic

Writer can enter only if:

readCount = 0

and

No Writer Active

Otherwise writer waits.

First Reader Locks

Interesting trick.

When first reader enters:

readCount becomes 1

First reader locks writers.

Now:

Writer Blocked

Additional readers can still enter.

Last Reader Unlocks

Suppose:

readCount = 1

Last reader exits.

Now:

readCount = 0

Writers become allowed.

